{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3275210/extras/496810e2006e8d22d1ddf81e0090b617.webp?t=1768349581\" width=919 height=50 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3275210/extras/296a8f470f978f3469c7065ef3ae569e.poster.avif?t=1768349581\" width=918 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3275210/extras/296a8f470f978f3469c7065ef3ae569e.webm?t=1768349581\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3275210/extras/296a8f470f978f3469c7065ef3ae569e.mp4?t=1768349581\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on jobs like trucker, where you would need to deliver cargo to keep the city running. Or lumberjack, taking down trees.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3275210/extras/52efcc7327a6f25a71e61c28b7594cd6.webp?t=1768349581\" width=919 height=50 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3275210/extras/ca1810937efd62ccd78765e0837820e2.poster.avif?t=1768349581\" width=918 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3275210/extras/ca1810937efd62ccd78765e0837820e2.webm?t=1768349581\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3275210/extras/ca1810937efd62ccd78765e0837820e2.mp4?t=1768349581\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy machinery, import goods at the docks, package the products, and fulfill your customers orders to increase your profits. Expand your factory, hire employees, and automate your business.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3275210/extras/0772ec697ef513e812b5f31ff12214d0.webp?t=1768349581\" width=919 height=50 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3275210/extras/6f6b440ee460eee14b281a7e6169e922.poster.avif?t=1768349581\" width=918 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3275210/extras/6f6b440ee460eee14b281a7e6169e922.webm?t=1768349581\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3275210/extras/6f6b440ee460eee14b281a7e6169e922.mp4?t=1768349581\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start a company with up to tens of friends working at the same time. Or play solo, and hire employee npcs to scale your production. Watch other enterpreneurs building comanies in the same online persistent world.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3275210/extras/fc24072b998d6e9a234e58f0fa67d87f.webp?t=1768349581\" width=919 height=50 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3275210/extras/c3d8e9559af77f0fb1d2123475223d2c.poster.avif?t=1768349581\" width=918 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3275210/extras/c3d8e9559af77f0fb1d2123475223d2c.webm?t=1768349581\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3275210/extras/c3d8e9559af77f0fb1d2123475223d2c.mp4?t=1768349581\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tune your cars, buy and furnish your properties around the map to match your style. Invite friends to your apartment. Race on the mountains on fast cars.\u00a0</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3275210?t=1768349581","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3275210?t=1768349581","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3275210/5bd0624814ab5b76a81ec2837a798ae1f52a6054/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768349581","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3275210/5bd0624814ab5b76a81ec2837a798ae1f52a6054/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768349581","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"MMO","id":20},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,5],"notes":"This game contains the following content that may not be suitable for all audiences:\r\n\r\nSuggestive Themes: Some characters appear in swimwear or underwear (no explicit nudity).\r\n\r\nCrime-Related Themes: Satirical references to unethical corporate behavior (e.g., tax evasion, unfair labor practices), though no direct criminal acts are depicted or glorified.\r\n\r\nMild Language: Occasional use of light profanity."},"detailed_description":"<h1>JOIN THE DISCORD!</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3275210/extras/f8f2934c8063be9f8c236cb249936751.avif?t=1768349581\" width=780 height=224 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3275210/extras/496810e2006e8d22d1ddf81e0090b617.webp?t=1768349581\" width=919 height=50 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3275210/extras/296a8f470f978f3469c7065ef3ae569e.poster.avif?t=1768349581\" width=918 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3275210/extras/296a8f470f978f3469c7065ef3ae569e.webm?t=1768349581\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3275210/extras/296a8f470f978f3469c7065ef3ae569e.mp4?t=1768349581\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on jobs like trucker, where you would need to deliver cargo to keep the city running. Or lumberjack, taking down trees.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3275210/extras/52efcc7327a6f25a71e61c28b7594cd6.webp?t=1768349581\" width=919 height=50 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shar