\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3275210/extras/fc24072b998d6e9a234e58f0fa67d87f.webp?t=1768349581\" width=919 height=50 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3275210/extras/c3d8e9559af77f0fb1d2123475223d2c.poster.avif?t=1768349581\" width=918 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3275210/extras/c3d8e9559af77f0fb1d2123475223d2c.webm?t=1768349581\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3275210/extras/c3d8e9559af77f0fb1d2123475223d2c.mp4?t=1768349581\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tune your cars, buy and furnish your properties around the map to match your style. Invite friends to your apartment. Race on the mountains on fast cars.\u00a0</p>","developers":["Pionero Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Massively Multiplayer","id":"29"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3275210/c89b545a3d86616e7bdc6c9c88cf8910dfdf6ca3/header.jpg?t=1768349581","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3275210/1441044805/0979b45efeb2c229de8cd29403196d33122f6d6a/1756579780/dash_av1.mpd?t=1764736667","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3275210/1441044805/0979b45efeb2c229de8cd29403196d33122f6d6a/1756579780/dash_h264.mpd?t=1764736667","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers